<title>PORTUGAL: Oporto Derivatives Exchange trade suspended.</title>
<headline>Oporto Derivatives Exchange trade suspended.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on the Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) was suspended due to communications problems, an official BDP source said.  </p>
<p>&quot;BDP trade is suspended for an undetermined period due to communications problems,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
